# Lessons learned

Prefer updating the most specific rule, skill or hook. Add an entry here only when its durable home is undecided or awaits approval.

Format:

```text
- [YYYY-MM-DD] [status:pending-migration|one-shot] [target:<name>|none] Context: ... | Mistake: ... | Rule: ...
```

Pending migrations older than 14 days are surfaced by the stop hook. Steady state is an empty log.

